
@'
# SkillBridge AI

An AI-powered career mentoring platform that helps students move from learning to earning.

## Vision

Help students identify what to learn, in what order, and which projects to build to become career-ready.

## Planned MVP

- Career selection
- Personalized AI learning roadmaps
- Progress tracking
- Free learning resource recommendations

## Technology Stack

- Frontend: Next.js and Tailwind CSS
- Backend: Next.js API Routes
- Database and Authentication: Supabase
- AI: Gemini API
- Deployment: Vercel

## Project Structure

- `frontend/` — User interface
- `backend/` — API and server-side functionality
- `database/` — Database planning and configuration
- `assets/` — Project assets
- `docs/` — Learning logs, decisions, errors, and resources

## Status

Day 1 — Project planning and repository setup.

## Development

This project is under active development. Features and architecture may evolve.
'@ | Set-Content README.md -Encoding utf8

@'
